sequenceDiagram
    participant Patient as Referrer or patient
    participant Coordinator
    participant Specialist
    participant Partner as Partner lab or pharmacy

    Patient->>Coordinator: contact for care
    Coordinator->>Specialist: check slot availability
    Coordinator->>Patient: connect by WhatsApp
    Specialist->>Coordinator: issue lab request or prescription
    Coordinator->>Partner: confirm availability, arrange payment and collection or delivery
    Coordinator->>Partner: follow up
    Partner-->>Coordinator: lab result
    Coordinator->>Specialist: bring back result
    Note over Patient,Partner: patient pays to avoid this hidden work,<br/>delays, and repeated queues
